Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 06:19:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] P5 integration: P2 RC2 accepted overlay (price, specs,
 warranty, brochures, logo, hero) + 40 heroes at /media/models/ and 54 logos
 at /media/brands/

Built on 4fe3ea0. buildCatalogue(snap,u,cw,p2) merges vehicle-data RC2 'accepted' per route and fails closed on
unknown route or p1_id mismatch. Rendering unchanged: P5 consumes accepted.hero_image via p2Hero(); the other
accepted fields are delivered for P5 to adopt. Replaces 5 P5 Nissan photos in place with the same models at 2400 px.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
